headline:
CLERK SHOOTS GIRL


AND ENDS OWN LIFE;


JEALOUSY ONE THEORY

HARRY FOX AND
OTHERS ON A


FAIR BILL;

text:
With faces schooled to act part,
And lying, practiced an art;


With conscience drugged, and faith asleep,
And secret treaties, hidden deep;


With mean advantage, basely won,


And self respect and honor gone.
With secret doors, and hidden springs,
And spies, and keyhole listenings;
With titled guests, to trap their host
And letters opened in the post;
With forgeries, and sharpers tricks,
And pitch that stains and mud that sticks;
With scraps of paper filled with words,
With braggart tongues, and ratified swords
With batteries, inspired by fear,
And smiles, to mask covert sneer;
With lips which pirate of "God on High
And giant guns, which shake Gods sky;
With poison gas, and peace conclave,
And every man weaponed slave;
And-in the end-a CHASTITY war.
And half the world grave.

